Usage

  sloctl aws-iam-ids direct <direct-name> [flags]

Examples

  sloctl aws-iam-ids direct my-cloudwatch-source
  sloctl aws-iam-ids direct my-cloudwatch-source --output json

Global Flags

• --config string: Path to config.toml. If unset, use SLOCTL_CONFIG_FILE_PATH or
the platform default.
• -c, --context string: Use this context instead of the configured default for
the selected command.
• -h, --help: Help for sloctl.
• -q, --jq string: Filter or transform command output using a jq expression.
• --no-config-file: For API authentication, use SLOCTL_CLIENT_ID and
SLOCTL_CLIENT_SECRET without reading or creating config.toml. Configuration
commands still access the file.
• -o, --output format: Output format: yaml, json, csv. (default yaml)

Error: Direct name must be provided
